    <div class="psic-card rev d2"><div class="psic-card-top" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fae8c8,#ef9f27)"></div><div class="avatar-3d"><div class="avatar-3d-inner" style="--c1:#f5c070;--c2:#ba7517">LP</div></div><h3>Laura Pons</h3><div class="psic-titol">Infantojuvenil</div><p>Especialista en TDAH, dislèxia, conducta i emocions en nens i adolescents.</p><div class="psic-tags"><span class="psic-tag">Infants</span><span class="psic-tag">TDAH</span><span class="psic-tag">Adolescents</span></div></div>
    <div class="psic-card rev d3"><div class="psic-card-top" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8e4f8,#7f77dd)"></div><div class="avatar-3d"><div class="avatar-3d-inner" style="--c1:#afa9ec;--c2:#534ab7">RF</div></div><h3>Rosa Ferrer</h3><div class="psic-titol">Logopeda</div><p>Avaluació i tractament de trastorns del llenguatge en totes les edats.</p><div class="psic-tags"><span class="psic-tag">Parla</span><span class="psic-tag">Llenguatge</span><span class="psic-tag">Totes edats</span></div></div>
  </div>
